This question gets asked enough that it might belong in the FAQ list.  Some
might consider the answer a spoiler, but I don't think so.  If knowing
that [color] dragon scale mail and the fact that artifacts exist is         
considered knowing a spoiler, then so should knowing that hell exists and
that the only way to get there is three obscure ways to teleport levels.
[c'mon, these things are part of the charm and plot of hack, not spoilers.]

My question is:  If you get a wish EARLY in the game -- when you're in
need of good armor AND weapons- would you wish for the weapon or the armor?

The FAQ is: What are the best things to wish for?
And I think it and its answer should be in the FAQ.  Perhaps only after a ^L.

